.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-AUDIT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-audit \- Check traces, namespaces, replays and quarantine against policy
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu audit\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-yupana\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItrace.jsonl\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check traces, namespaces, replays and quarantine against policy
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-yupana\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItrace.jsonl\fR>

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-audit\-inventory(1)
List the policies the audit checks against
.TP
quipu\-audit\-namespace(1)
Report base\-namespace drift
.TP
quipu\-audit\-replay(1)
Re\-derive a gate decision as of its transaction
.TP
quipu\-audit\-tree(1)
Reassemble the dispatch forest from a trace\*(Aqs principal chains
.TP
quipu\-audit\-inheritance(1)
Check whether inherited constraints stopped applying under delegation
.TP
quipu\-audit\-quarantine(1)
List refused\-attempt evidence behind verdicts
.TP
quipu\-audit\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
